80w, /media/photos/process-review-768.webp 768w, /media/photos/process-review-1024.webp 1024w, /media/photos/process-review-1440.webp 1440w, /media/photos/process-review-2400.webp 2400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 43vw, 21vw\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"A courier and customer reviewing delivery paperwork together on a clipboard\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-illustrative=\"true\"></div><span>02</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h3>Receive a reviewed quote</h3><p>Service details, inclusions and exclusions are confirmed for the enquiry.</p></li><li><div class=\"process-photo process-photo-dispatch\" data-image-feedback=\"photo\" data-photo-frame=\"\"><img src=\"/media/photos/process-dispatch-2400.webp\" srcset=\"/media/photos/process-dispatch-480.webp 480w, /media/photos/process-dispatch-768.webp 768w, /media/photos/process-dispatch-1024.webp 1024w, /media/photos/process-dispatch-1440.webp 1440w, /media/photos/process-dispatch-2400.webp 2400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 43vw, 21vw\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"Two delivery workers loading cardboard parcels into the back of a van\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-illustrative=\"true\"></div><span>03</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg><h3>Arrange dispatch</h3><p>An accepted quote becomes a booking ready for coordination.</p></li><li><div class=\"process-photo process-photo-scan\" data-image-feedback=\"photo\" data-photo-frame=\"\"><img src=\"/media/photos/process-scan-1080.webp\" srcset=\"/media/photos/process-scan-480.webp 480w, /media/photos/process-scan-768.webp 768w, /media/photos/process-scan-1024.webp 1024w, /media/photos/process-scan-1080.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 43vw, 21vw\" width=\"1080\" height=\"570\" alt=\"A handheld barcode scanner reading the label on a cardboard parcel\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-illustrative=\"true\"></div><span>04</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3>Follow verified updates</h3><p>Contact the team for customer-safe shipment updates.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"action-entry section-white\"><div class=\"shell action-entry-grid\"><article><span class=\"action-number\">01</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start with the shipment</p><h2>Request a considered quote.</h2><p>Share the details once. Our team reviews each request before confirming service or charges.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"/get-a-quote\">Get a quote <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></article></div></section><section class=\"editorial-section company-feature\"><div class=\"shell editorial-grid\"><div class=\"editorial-image\" data-image-feedback=\"photo\" data-photo-frame=\"\"><img src=\"/media/photos/workspace-1717.webp\" srcset=\"/media/photos/workspace-480.webp 480w, /media/photos/workspace-768.webp 768w, /media/photos/workspace-1024.webp 1024w, /media/photos/workspace-1440.webp 1440w, /media/photos/workspace-1717.webp 1717w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 58vw\" width=\"1717\" height=\"916\" alt=\"Illustrative modern parcel dispatch workspace\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-illustrative=\"true\"><span>Illustrative operations environment</span></div><div class=\"editorial-copy\"><p class=\"section-index\">03 / Company</p><p class=\"eyebrow\">About VK AND COMPANY</p><h2>Built around each shipment.</h2><p>Our customer journey is straightforward: share the details, receive a reviewed offer, arrange a booking and follow genuine updates.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/about\">More about our process <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"homepage-faq section-white\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Common questions</p><h2>Useful answers,<br>before you send.</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/faq\">View all FAQs <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>How do I request a courier quote?</summary><p>Share your contact, route and parcel details in the quotation form. The team will review your request and contact you with a confirmed offer.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>Does submitting the form confirm my booking?</summary><p>No. It creates an enquiry only. A booking is created after a quote has been prepared and accepted.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>Can all international parcels be accepted?</summary><p>Acceptance depends on the contents, documentation, route availability and applicable restrictions. These are confirmed for the specific shipment.</p></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>Is pickup automatically scheduled?</summary><p>No. Pickup requests are currently unavailable. When enabled, a requested date will still need staff confirmation.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-finale\"><div class=\"shell contact-finale-inner\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Contact &amp; support</p><h2>Need help with the next step?</h2><p>Send a secure general or shipment-related enquiry for the team to review.</p></div><a class=\"button button-teal\" href=\"/contact\">Contact the team <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"brand footer-lo